ence with effective Error metric; MetricOutput uses reference with the retained terminal metric.","DISPOSITION":"PARSED_REPRESENTATION","NOTES":""},{"PARSE_UNIT_ID":"R41-U0025","SOURCE_REPOSITORY":"bjoern-janson/tevpp","SOURCE_COMMIT":"6b38882224bf8d3cd11b237eb6d3caf0718accdc","SOURCE_PATH":"include/tev/Measurement.h","SOURCE_BLOB":"be410bdcde48abdb5620afe59855d3a747dafd62","SOURCE_SECTION_PATH":"measurementUpstreamStage / measurementDownstreamStage","UNIT_KIND":"METHODOLOGICAL_NOTE","SOURCE_STANDING_LABEL":"METHODOLOGY_OR_TEST_PROTOCOL","NORMALIZED_CONTENT":"Upstream traversal is MetricOutput -> SignedDifference -> Inputs; downstream traversal reverses that order. No transition exists beyond either endpoint.","DISPOSITION":"PARSED_REPRESENTATION","NOTES":""},{"PARSE_UNIT_ID":"R41-U0026","SOURCE_REPOSITORY":"bjoern-janson/tevpp","SOURCE_COMMIT":"6b38882224bf8d3cd11b237eb6d3caf0718accdc","SOURCE_PATH":"include/tev/Measurement.h","SOURCE_BLOB":"be410bdcde48abdb5620afe59855d3a747dafd62","SOURCE_SECTION_PATH":"measurementMetricFormula","UNIT_KIND":"FORMAL_STRUCTURE","SOURCE_STANDING_LABEL":"FORMAL_STRUCTURE","NORMALIZED_CONTENT":"Metric formulas are C-R, |C-R|, (C-R)^2, |C-R|/(R+epsilon), and (C-R)^2/(R^2+epsilon), with epsilon from MeasurementMetricSpec.","DISPOSITION":"PARSED_REPRESENTATION","NOTES":""},{"PARSE_UNIT_ID":"R41-U0027","SOURCE_REPOSITORY":"bjoern-janson/tevpp","SOURCE_COMMIT":"6b38882224bf8d3cd11b237eb6d3caf0718accdc","SOURCE_PATH":"include/tev/Measurement.h","SOURCE_BLOB":"be410bdcde48abdb5620afe59855d3a747dafd62","SOURCE_SECTION_PATH":"measurementCorrespondencePathsAgree","UNIT_KIND":"METHODOLOGICAL_NOTE","SOURCE_STANDING_LABEL":"METHODOLOGY_OR_TEST_PROTOCOL","NORMALIZED_CONTENT":"measurementCorrespondencePathsAgree compares the two stored reference offsets rather than assuming equivalence.","DISPOSITION":"PARSED_REPRESENTATION","NOTES":""},{"PARSE_UNIT_ID":"R41-U0028","SOURCE_REPOSITORY":"bjoern-janson/tevpp","SOURCE_COMMIT":"6b38882224bf8d3cd11b237eb6